  "details": "Description\n\nVR mode Chat Bubble clipping with Avatar body. As a VR user, I set chat bubble location in front of the avatar's middle body. It worked well however, recently, around 2 weeks, it clipped with my friends' Avatars' body now.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nAs a VR user, I set chat bubble location in front of the avatar's middle body. It worked well however, recently, around 2 weeks, it clipped with my friends' Avatars' body now.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p2-1938-565822d00a-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
